<ul>
<li><a href="/Doc/common/">Common</a> - Shared traits and ActionEffect system</li>
<li><a href="/Doc/mountain/">Mountain</a> - Main backend (Grove integration)</li>
<li><a href="/Doc/cocoon/">Cocoon</a> - Primary extension host (Node.js)</li>
<li><a href="/Doc/api-reference/">InterComponentProtocol</a> - gRPC protocol specification</li>
<li><a href="/Doc/architecture/">RustInfrastructure</a> - Rust backend components</li>
</ul>
